{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How Many Dudes?</strong></u><strong>\u00a0is an autobattler roguelike that seeks to answer one of humanity's oldest questions - How many dudes does it take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/eef13f2748e13b6b3b32aeea5274393e.poster.avif?t=1759951469\" width=918 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/eef13f2748e13b6b3b32aeea5274393e.webm?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/eef13f2748e13b6b3b32aeea5274393e.mp4?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many Dudes does it take to beat a thousand toddlers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silverback gorilla?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horse-sized duck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A GOD?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/3850cd15c64afc90adc91c2e35c5f867.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1260 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/f9f559d0341efac0c151f1e6ab49f529.poster.avif?t=1759951469\" width=732 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/f9f559d0341efac0c151f1e6ab49f529.webm?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/f9f559d0341efac0c151f1e6ab49f529.mp4?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the Dude Ranch, where you recruit and manage your ever-expanding army of Dude</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from  a wild cast of Dude Families: Undead Dudes, Workin' Dudes, Warrior Dudes, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setup your Dude Roster to mix and match Dudes and form ridiculous synergies - like Zombie Dudes who get stronger as other Dudes fall in battle, or Ninja Dudes who enter the arena shrouded in shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run brings a fresh batch of Dudes for you to choose from.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/bbfa2b5b0b95e445199701341d5b6772.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1260 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Create game-breaking synergies with your roster of Dudes and strange powers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/c1fe26f6a84afe3917406f289ccc2a59.poster.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1170 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/c1fe26f6a84afe3917406f289ccc2a59.webm?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/c1fe26f6a84afe3917406f289ccc2a59.mp4?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dozens of Dude Relics that warp the rules of battle. Make your Boxer Dudes explode enemies they throw, your Ninja Dudes enter stealth after a kill, or Workin' Dudes generate more cash with each win.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your Dudes wisely. Each Dude has their place in battle, from dishing out damage to tanking it to commanding other Dudes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/09400f79576783296da78ee6741a527f.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1260 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Face escalating enemy waves\u2014from toddlers to wolves to gorillas to gods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/a8b36570e40c4d677a7d5b61d3500c71.poster.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/a8b36570e40c4d677a7d5b61d3500c71.webm?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/a8b36570e40c4d677a7d5b61d3500c71.mp4?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer boss fights that test your team\u2019s synergy (and your sanity).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Dude Ranch between runs to unlock new recruits, relics, and harder challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/616980d89741bfbb8f8a67c806dbbf8b.avif?t=1759951469\" width=1260 height=144 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic auto-battler roguelite full of game-breaking synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Dude types to recruit, unlock, and manage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics and synergies that completely reshape each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights and escalating nonsense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability and absurdity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac TL;DR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Slay the Spire meets Totally Accurate Battle Simulator, but everyone\u2019s a Dude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your Dudes. Expand your Ranch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And find out how many  it takes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934270?t=1759951469","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3934270?t=1759951469","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/1ee0f72400cddac5993cd1dc06b8d5beff966877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759951469","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/1ee0f72400cddac5993cd1dc06b8d5beff966877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759951469","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How Many Dudes?</strong></u><strong>\u00a0is an autobattler roguelike that seeks to answer one of humanity's oldest questions - How many dudes does it take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/eef13f2748e13b6b3b32aeea5274393e.poster.avif?t=1759951469\" width=918 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934270/extras/eef13f2748e13b6b3b32aeea5274393e.webm?t=1759951469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.